          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE 3: NOISE TEXTURE\n\nNoise can be converted to texture using the To Texture node.\nIn this example we use the noise to create a texture and that texture is used to UV-offset the Texture In node. The is a very simple example of how Noise can be used to create distortion effects.\n\nNote that the Noise node is instantiated and has an unique seed for every instance.\nThis is to prevent the Node from creating the same value on every channel."
          }
        },
